{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方凌晨四時許，在何文田拘捕一名男子涉嫌停牌期間偷電單車駕駛，並搜出懷疑毒品。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">男子被鎖上手銬，在電單車旁接受調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRUG-0700_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026EEqBQs5wRb1784938564.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRUG-0700_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場消息指，警方在何文田公主道，近衛理道交界發現一輛電單車左搖右擺，車尾燈損毀，於是上前截查，在電單車尾箱發現懷疑毒品。之後以涉嫌販毒，偷車、停牌期間駕駛等，拘捕48歲男司機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRUG-0700_004.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026c3iX8YtDm41784938568.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRUG-0700_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T00:38:15.738452+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}